 * - XIAO ESP32C6 board
 * - DHT11 Temperature and Humidity Sensor
 * 
 * Connections:
 * - DHT11 Data Pin -> D2 (GPIO8) of XIAO ESP32C6
 * - DHT11 VCC -> 3.3V
 * - DHT11 GND -> GND
 * 
 * The device operates as a Zigbee end device and goes into deep sleep between measurements
 * to conserve power.
